          "The Customer is responsible to the Forwarder for all actual damages or losses, expenses, costs, and official payments resulting from incorrect or incomplete information and instructions provided by the Customer, as well as from the transfer of goods by the Customer or any other person acting on behalf of the Customer, which caused the loss or damage to property, harm to the environment, or other types of damage.",
