          "The Forwarder is not liable if the Customer entrusts the Forwarder with transporting hazardous, prohibited, or restricted cargo by road or rail without notifying the Forwarder. The Customer shall reimburse the Forwarder for all expenses related to the transfer and transportation of such cargo, and compensate the Forwarder for any damages incurred.",
